cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "TSCOPF.jl: Transient-Stability-Constrained Optimal Power Flow in Julia/JuMP"
abstract: >-
  TSCOPF.jl builds and solves steady-state optimal power flow subproblems
  (economic dispatch, DC-OPF, AC-OPF, unit commitment) together with
  transient-stability-constrained formulations over Kron-reduced or full-bus
  networks, classical second-order or fourth-order dq machines, optional AVR and
  TGOV1 governor blocks, and mixed synchronous plus grid-forming fleets. Duals
  of every constraint family are exported for economic interpretation.
type: software
version: 0.1.2
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/alexupm95/TSCOPF.jl"
url: "https://alexupm95.github.io/TSCOPF.jl/dev/"
